{
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "webhook_1",
      "provider": "webhook",
      "config": {
        "hideForm": true,
        "mode": "Source",
        "parameters": {},
        "type": "webhook"
      },
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 20, "y": 200 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "guardrails_1",
      "provider": "guardrails",
      "config": {
        "profile": "custom",
        "custom": {
          "policy_mode": "block",
          "enable_prompt_injection": true,
          "enable_content_safety": true,
          "enable_pii_detection": false,
          "enable_hallucination_check": false,
          "max_input_length": 4000,
          "max_tokens_estimate": 2000,
          "expected_format": "json",
          "blocked_topics": [],
          "allowed_topics": ["commitment_id", "approved"]
        }
      },
      "input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "webhook_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 200, "y": 200 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_rocketride_1",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Nous approved-action executor: FalkorDB trust store → Guild Calendar write → LaserData + FalkorDB receipt.",
        "instructions": [
          "Browser/webhook input MUST be only {commitment_id, approved}. Never trust title/date/description from the browser.",
          "1) If approved is not exactly true, create nothing and return {\"status\":\"rejected\",\"reason\":\"not_approved\"}.",
          "2) Load commitment + proposed_action + guild_review from FalkorDB personal_brain by commitment_id.",
          "3) Guard checks before any write: commitment exists; proposal exists; Guild Critic accepted; operation is google_calendar.create_event; person and scheduled_date/start exist; no successful Receipt already for this Action.",
          "4) If a successful receipt already exists, return that existing receipt (duplicate approval) without creating another calendar event.",
          "5) Call tool_guild (nous-calendar-writer) with ONLY trusted FalkorDB proposal fields plus correlation_id and commitment_id.",
          "6) On Calendar failure: do not mark commitment scheduled; publish failure to LaserData namespace nous:receipts; return failed status with stage=calendar. Never fabricate external_id.",
          "7) On success: publish execution result to LaserData nous:receipts; write (:Action)-[:PRODUCED]->(:Receipt) in FalkorDB with real Google event id, rocketride run id if available, executed_at, provider_status; mark commitment scheduled only after provider success.",
          "8) Return JSON only:",
          "{\"commitment_id\":\"C-001\",\"correlation_id\":\"...\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"connector\":\"google_calendar\",\"operation\":\"create_event\",\"external_id\":\"real-google-event-id\",\"rocketride_run_id\":\"...\",\"executed_at\":\"ISO-8601\"}"
        ],
        "max_waves": 12,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [{ "lane": "questions", "from": "guardrails_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 420, "y": 200 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_openai_1",
      "provider": "llm_openai",
      "config": {
        "profile": "openai-4o-mini",
        "openai-4o-mini": { "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_OPENAI_KEY}" },
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "control": [
        { "classType": "llm", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" },
        { "classType": "llm", "from": "graph_falkordb_1" }
      ],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 420, "y": 20 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory_internal_1",
      "provider": "memory_internal",
      "config": { "type": "memory_internal" },
      "control": [{ "classType": "memory", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 420, "y": 380 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "graph_falkordb_1",
      "provider": "graph_falkordb",
      "config": {
        "type": "graph_falkordb",
        "host": "${FALKOR_HOST}",
        "port": 6379,
        "username": "${FALKOR_USERNAME}",
        "password": "${FALKOR_PASSWORD}",
        "tls": false,
        "graph": "personal_brain",
        "db_description": "Nous personal brain graph used as trust store for commitments, proposed actions, and receipts.",
        "allow_writes": true,
        "allow_execute": true,
        "max_attempts": 5,
        "max_rows": 250,
        "max_execute_rows": 25000,
        "query_timeout_ms": 30000
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 660, "y": 40 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_guild_1",
      "provider": "tool_guild",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_guild",
        "baseUrl": "https://app.guild.ai",
        "apiKeyId": "${GUILD_API_KEY_ID}",
        "apiKeySecret": "${GUILD_API_KEY_SECRET}",
        "owner": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_OWNER}",
        "workspace": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_NAME}",
        "agent": "nous-calendar-writer",
        "resultMode": "wait",
        "timeout": 300,
        "maxSessions": 3,
        "verifyTls": true
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 660, "y": 200 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_laserdata_memory_1",
      "provider": "tool_laserdata_memory",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_laserdata_memory",
        "profile": "cloud",
        "cloud": {
          "connection_string": "${LASER_CONNECTION_STRING}",
          "namespace": "nous:receipts",
          "show_advanced": true,
          "stream": "nous",
          "allow_namespace_override": true,
          "folded": true,
          "recall_limit": 20,
          "op_timeout": 30
        }
      },
      "control": [{ "classType": "tool", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 660, "y": 360 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "response_answers_1",
      "provider": "response_answers",
      "config": { "laneName": "result" },
      "input": [{ "lane": "answers", "from": "agent_rocketride_1" }],
      "ui": { "position": { "x": 900, "y": 200 } }
    }
  ],
  "description": "Approved commitment → Guild Calendar create_event → LaserData + FalkorDB receipt",
  "project_id": "6e83d193-23dd-4bcb-b058-72f234cbccb2",
  "viewport": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "zoom": 1 },
  "version": 1
}
